; Public apple cultivars - test fixture for the Pedimap 2 .dat parser/exporter.
; Built only from public information: cultivar names, commonly published
; parentage, and published S-allele genotypes. "-" marks a genotype not given
; here.
; Seed/pollen parent order follows common records and is not verified for
; every cross. BATCH values are arbitrary test labels.
;
; Fuji-self-01 is a SYNTHETIC record, not a real seedling. It exercises a
; selfing written as the same parent twice and an S-allele incompatibility
; (S24 is not an allele of Fuji, S1S9), hence S_QC = 2.
;
; S_QC: 0 = untestable (a parent or offspring genotype is missing)
;       1 = consistent with the parents   2 = incompatible with the parents
; Not a reference dataset.

POPULATION = Apple-Public
UNKNOWN    = -
NULLHOMOZ  = $
NALLELES   = 0
PLOIDY     = 2

PEDIGREE
NAME                 FEMALE               MALE              S_1  S_2  S1_S2   BATCH  S_QC
Golden-Delicious     -                    -                 S2   S3   S2S3    B1     0
Red-Delicious        -                    -                 S9   S28  S9S28   B1     0
Cox's-Orange-Pippin  -                    -                 S5   S9   S5S9    B1     0
Jonathan             -                    -                 S7   S9   S7S9    B1     0
McIntosh             -                    -                 S10  S25  S10S25  B2     0
Fuji                 -                    -                 S1   S9   S1S9    B2     0
Wagener              -                    -                 -    -    -       B2     0
Rome-Beauty          -                    -                 -    -    -       B2     0
Ingrid-Marie         -                    -                 -    -    -       B1     0
Gala                 Kidd's-Orange-Red    Golden-Delicious  S2   S5   S2S5    B1+B2  0
Kidd's-Orange-Red    Cox's-Orange-Pippin  Red-Delicious     -    -    -       B1     0
Idared               Jonathan             Wagener           S3   S7   S3S7    B1     0
Melrose              Jonathan             Red-Delicious     -    -    -       B2     0
Monroe               Jonathan             Rome-Beauty       -    -    -       B2     0
Elstar               Golden-Delicious     Ingrid-Marie      S3   S5   S3S5    B1     0
Fuji-self-01         Fuji                 Fuji              S1   S24  S1S24   B2     2
